'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Issued on December 10, 2025,<ref>[https://x.com/helldivers2/status/1998694453406552223 HELLDIVERS™ 2 | Twitter]</ref> to [[Helldiver]]s who logged in between September 2 and November 4, 2025.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link to file] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref>

== Lore ==
Issued to all Helldivers for their triumph over the [[Hive World]] [[Oshaune]], having had successfully {{MajorOrderLink | id = A2-10-6 | text = liberated the Hive World}}.

